   •   Synthesizing literature across disciplines
   •   Generating and evaluating hypotheses
   •   Simulating alternative architectural pathways
   •   Flagging epistemic uncertainty and ethical risk

AETHERMIND thus transforms research from a sequence of tasks into a closed-loop cognitive process.

