7. Governance as a First-Class Architectural Primitive

Both AETHERMIND and Cerebra-Q treat human-in-the-loop governance as intrinsic rather than optional. Ethical reasoning, oversight, and value alignment are embedded within the cognitive loop, mitigating risks introduced by rapid iteration and high-power abstraction.

This design choice reflects a critical insight:

When intelligence scales faster than institutions, governance must scale with cognition.

